Syntax: ptell <person> <message>
Syntax: psay <message>
Syntax: pshout <message>

Psionic telepathy is the foundational power that first manifests in those
born with the gift. It allows the psionicist to project their thoughts
directly into the minds of others, communicating without words or sound.

The ptell command sends a private telepathic message to a specific person
anywhere in the world. The recipient perceives the message as a thought
that simply appears in their consciousness, distinct from their own.

The psay command broadcasts a thought to all minds within the immediate
vicinity, allowing others in the same room to perceive your projected
thoughts. Creatures in the room will see a message indicating you are
thinking rather than speaking aloud.

The pshout command is the most taxing form of telepathic communication,
broadcasting a thought to all receptive minds throughout the world.
This should be used sparingly, as flooding the world with mental noise
is considered impolite among the gifted.

All forms of telepathic communication consume mana. The power cannot be
used while focusing your mind, as the concentration required for mind
focus precludes external projection.

